{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_8001_p", "source_sha256": "16cff07aac266b7fdc0899f3477202a5f346fc4329cf96ce56f6bc3641c84457", "ja": "（アイドル雑誌『ViDaVo!』のグラビア企画。\n風花のテーマは『新人を指導する先輩警察官』だ）", "zh": "（偶像杂志《ViDaVo!》的写真企划。\n风花的主题是“指导新人的前辈警察官”。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_8002_041fuk", "source_sha256": "9c0faa9363c51cb43eb09cf48f61dd2f1eaeb93945d5ab0d45c4015dda901369", "ja": "どうですか、{$P$}さん。\nカッコイイ先輩に見えますか？", "zh": "你觉得怎么样，{$P$}先生？\n看起来像个帅气的前辈吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_8003_p", "source_sha256": "5fea2ac3d3c723fe8219de93c5549d85cb48b5a761a928a85ca77b7dfc48522f", "ja": "ああ。カッコよさももちろんあるけど、\n優しく見守ってくれそうな先輩って感じもするな。", "zh": "嗯。帅气当然也有，不过感觉你也是那种会温柔守护后辈的前辈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_8004_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a4e758a63369919d3ef64680e8013172d105b4f692f307e301e9cac5fe275b13", "ja": "本当ですか？　ふふっ、嬉しいです♪\n新人さんを指導するってことですけど……。", "zh": "真的吗？呵呵，我很开心♪\n不过，说是要指导新人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_8005_041fuk", "source_sha256": "8e7bb334b08fef9c65f3c2ccb177ad85ee3c619a7d3c882c4306dcd5d0379a43", "ja": "どういった内容を教えればいいんでしょう？　資料に\nいくつか例が書かれてますけど、悩んでしまって……。", "zh": "要教些什么内容呢？资料里虽然写了几个例子，但我还是有些苦恼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_8006_p", "source_sha256": "717997f00c9fc5dcd30254802dcaed9b9512eb4823c70a107bd729f66c7f2a05", "ja": "うーん、そうだな……。", "zh": "唔～这个嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_8007", "source_sha256": "9a9310b448569692bc00d80c3c87d2bc474cd4e0049769188cc4b0472754e5d9", "ja": "救急法", "zh": "急救法", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_8008", "source_sha256": "6834d2cab8c7b554f65d4372c8693fa70e0fcb2cc4aa7b26e1a3c83f6f93cf2d", "ja": "心構え", "zh": "心理准备", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_8009", "source_sha256": "656435c580894e89a363dfe645fb28405e9300f542a5f8b3d71b09367051f295", "ja": "美の秘訣", "zh": "美丽的秘诀", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_8100_p", "source_sha256": "977718c14ab1a14fa1050077bf22cf2e0d9b6b497fc0b1123e47e683bf7383b0", "ja": "救急法なら風花も想像しやすいんじゃないか？\n警察官も生死に関わる仕事だからな。", "zh": "如果是急救法，风花应该也比较容易想象吧？毕竟警察也是关系到生死的工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_8101_041fuk", "source_sha256": "ad568a6266a9bfda96dbcfb012edff8b3f98394a597d2d6a21af5ba952791723", "ja": "それなら、私にもできそうです。救急法は\n警察官にとっても欠かせない知識だと思いますし。", "zh": "这样的话，我好像也能做到。急救法对警察来说也是不可或缺的知识。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_8102_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d0bf308c98370fb4f49a7f906bd1cc0a72a7ce4d9683f77117f6a8b5d22ba061", "ja": "応急処置の大切さを教えるように……。\nうん、これなら撮影もうまくできそうな気がします♪", "zh": "去传达急救措施的重要性……\n嗯，这样的话感觉也能把拍摄顺利完成呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_8200_p", "source_sha256": "792400d1e688bc4b130641d9467fafaaab9c7cb2600273ccdbde894242e8203b", "ja": "警察官としての心構えを教えるのはどうだ？　人と\n向き合う仕事だ。精神面の強さも大切だと思うんだ。", "zh": "教她作为警察应有的觉悟怎么样？这是份要与人打交道的工作。我觉得精神上的坚强也很重要。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_8201_041fuk", "source_sha256": "5a541dbdc0e1a01026000ebdb0588c21965e428992942b658c43b086bbec3486", "ja": "なるほど……。たしかに、危険と隣合わせの世界です\nから、強い精神力が必要ですよね。", "zh": "原来如此……确实，这是个与危险相伴的世界，所以需要坚强的意志力呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_8202_041fuk", "source_sha256": "9e2dab1a631c2f257222545b6cd43503cd610fe8ef5461d91ca539d98f1a45e3", "ja": "強くて優しい心を持った警察官に導いてあげるように\n……。私も強い精神力で挑みたいと思います！", "zh": "为了能将对方引导成为坚强而温柔的警察\n……我也打算以坚强的意志去挑战！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_8300_p", "source_sha256": "3e1d07acd62cd5c8d2274db448d84001655774b32c0bd112857f754e878d7190", "ja": "まず世間話で相手の心を開いてみるとかどうだろう。\n美の秘訣を教えてみるとか！", "zh": "要不要先试着闲聊几句，打开对方的心扉呢？\n比如传授一下保持美丽的秘诀什么的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_8301_041fuk", "source_sha256": "3d4727e78070d3282cc4661e70405dc4bdbba1752579a56bb7fafbe08ee9160c", "ja": "び、美の秘訣、ですか……？　世間話にしても、\n警察官のお仕事に関係ない気もしますけど……。", "zh": "美、美丽的秘诀吗……？就算当作闲聊，感觉也和警察的工作没什么关系……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_8302_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c22469da7bd9373a920acce317c40b459159a1fb47746e53a2eb594fd94ea403", "ja": "気さくな先輩ってイメージなら、いいのかも？\nでも、もう少し警察官らしい姿の方がいいような……。", "zh": "如果是给人平易近人的前辈印象，或许也不错？\n不过，我觉得还是稍微展现出一些警察官的样子比较好……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
